WEBVTT

NOTE
Opening Credits FMV for Final Fantasy VIII. Features white text credits on black background interspersed with dramatic character introduction shots and iconic imagery. The audio track plays "Liberi Fatali" and "Fithos Lusec Wecos Vinosec." Duration: approximately 3 minutes 52 seconds (232 seconds).

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Black screen. White SQUARESOFT logo appears centered on the screen, large and prominent. Dramatic orchestral music begins.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The logo fades. White text appears: "PRODUCER" and producer credits scroll down the center of the black screen, credits for Kazushige Nojima, Akira Tabata, and others listed.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Credits fade. A black-and-white close-up shot of Squall Leonhart appears. He wears his iconic leather jacket with numerous belts across his chest and waist. A chain-link fence is visible behind him. Squall's expression is brooding and intense, his eyes fixed forward with determination. His gunblade is visible at his side.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Squall's image fades to black. White text credits scroll: "CHARACTER DESIGN" and designer names appear, listing Tetsuya Nomura and team.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The credits fade. A dramatic shot of Rinoa Heartilly appears, captured mid-turn or mid-reach. She wears a light-colored sleeveless dress. White feathers float around her, creating a soft, ethereal atmosphere. Her expression is determined and gentle.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Rinoa's image transitions to black. White text appears: "SCENARIO" with writer credits including Kazushige Nojima's name prominently displayed.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A powerful image of Seifer Almasy dominates the screen. He stands in a low-angle shot, towering over the viewpoint. His grey trench coat flows dramatically. His expression is confident, aggressive, and determined. His gunblade is visible, sheathed at his side. The lighting emphasizes his imposing presence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Seifer's image fades. White credits text scrolls: "MUSIC" followed by Nobuo Uematsu's name and other composer credits for the soundtrack.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
A shot of Quistis Trepe appears. She is shown in her instructor uniform, her distinctive long hair flowing. Her whip weapon is visible in her hand or near her side, coiled and ready. Her expression is professional and focused.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Quistis fades. White text credits scroll down: "SOUND" followed by sound engineer and audio team credits.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Zell Dincht's image bursts onto the screen. The young martial artist performs an energetic kick or flip. His distinctive facial tattoo is prominent across his forehead. He wears his leather jacket. His movement is dynamic and full of youth and energy.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Zell's action shot fades. Black screen with white text: "PROGRAMMING" followed by programming team credits listing multiple names.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Selphie Tilmott appears on screen, energetic and cheerful. She wields her nunchaku weapon, twirling it dynamically. Her youthful, energetic expression and short hair are characteristic. The scene captures her spirited nature.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Selphie's image transitions to black. White credits text scrolls: "GRAPHICS" with art director and graphics team credits listed.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Irvine Kinneas appears, striking a confident pose. He wears his signature light-colored duster jacket and his iconic white cowboy hat. His sharpshooter rifle is visible. His expression is charming and assured.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Irvine fades. White text credits appear: "EXECUTIVE PRODUCER" followed by key executive credits and names.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
A striking image of Sorceress Edea dominates the screen. She strides forward with commanding presence. Her distinctive horned headdress towers above her head, silhouetted dramatically against the background. Her long dress trails as she moves. Her expression is imperious and powerful, radiating magical authority.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Edea's image fades to black. White text scrolls: "SPECIAL THANKS" followed by credits to support teams, consultants, and other contributors.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
A nighttime shot of Balamb Garden appears. The massive military academy building is illuminated by moonlight. Its distinctive architecture is silhouetted against the night sky. The setting is serene but imposing, established as a significant location.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Balamb Garden fades. A close-up shot shows a gunblade lying in an open case or on a surface. The distinctive curved blade and handle are prominently displayed. Ammunition rounds are visible beside the weapon, gleaming in cool light.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.000
The gunblade case transitions. A shot of the SeeD emblem or crest appears, large and centered. The symbol is intricate and meaningful, representing the elite military organization.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
The emblem fades. Credits continue scrolling with white text on black: various department credits, localization teams, and production assistants listed.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
More credits scroll in white text on black background: quality assurance, testing teams, and support departments are acknowledged with their names and roles.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
A transitional shot appears: a sweeping view of Deling City at night, with lights twinkling in the distance. The cityscape establishes the setting of the story's opening act.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Deling City fades. White credits text continues scrolling: additional thanks, acknowledgments, and final staff listings appear against the black background.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Credits scroll in white text: Publishing credits, distribution information, and licensing credits appear listed on the black background.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
More credit text scrolls: Platform-specific credits, technical credits, and additional production information displayed in white on black.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000
A dramatic crane shot pans across a nighttime landscape. Mountains or city structures are silhouetted against the dark sky. The scene is moody and atmospheric.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
The landscape fades. White credits text continues scrolling: Final credits, acknowledgments, and thank you messages listed in white on black background.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Credits scroll: Additional staff recognition, department names, and final production credits appear in white text.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
More scrolling white text: Final specialized credits, additional thanks, and concluding staff listings against black background.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
A romantic scene appears: Rinoa stands in a field of white flowers. White feathers float and swirl around her in slow motion. Her dress flows gently. Her expression is peaceful and dreamy. Soft light illuminates her.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Rinoa's image fades slowly. The field of flowers blurs. White feathers continue to fall gently through the frame.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
The flower field fades to white. Against the pure white background, the FINAL FANTASY VIII logo appears in large, bold letters. The iconic game title is centered and stands out dramatically.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.000
The FINAL FANTASY VIII logo remains centered on the white background as the music crescendos and the opening credits sequence concludes.
